# meme-maker — sensible gitignore

# Dependencies
node_modules/
# (package-lock.json is intentionally committed for reproducible installs)

# Generated / temp
frames/
.web-uploads/
*.tmp
__*.mp4
__*.gif
*.log

# Output artifacts we usually don't want in git
meme.gif
meme.mp4
clip.mp4
clip.mp3
gifs/
videos/
audio/
Audio/
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.gif
*.png

# But keep some example inputs
!*_terminal.html
!test_term.html
!seki-term.html

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# The old standalone meme (keep it if you want, but it's duplicated logic)
# Memes/mememaker.sh   ← uncomment if you want to ignore it
# Local-only project context.
project-memory.md
project-journal.md
AGENTS.md
AGENT.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
MEMORY.md

project.grok
.grok/
.codex/
.grok-scratch/
*.grok-tmp
